   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Candles of Hope</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reviving Home&apos;s Candles of Hope program aims to provide education resources to students in war and crisis-torn countries. Phase 1 involves a small classroom of 10 students in one grade level in their home country. Due to years out of school, students will be assessed and periodically reassessed to determine their education level. Project enables COH by RH to develop an effective, scalable system for deploying education resources, with benefits that will endure beyond the demonstration project.</narrative>
  </description>
